//RS /// One scalar job parameter as a command input. The shape follows the `#CLI`
//RS /// record field rules (`CLISchema::command_schema_with_items`): `Bool` is a
//RS /// flag, `?T` is optional, a default makes a non-optional value with that
//RS /// default, and a required value fills positionally.
